        {
          "id": "3b83cf27-e8a7-4085-8a5a-bb46741c42aa",
          "name": "Submit eligibility questionnaire",
          "request": {
            "name": "Submit eligibility questionnaire",
            "description": {
              "content": "Submits an eligibility questionnaire for a contractor employment.\n\nThe questionnaire determines if the contractor is eligible for certain products or features.\nThe responses are validated against the JSON schema for the questionnaire type.\n\n**Requirements:**\n- Employment must be of type `contractor`\n- Employment must be in `created` status\n- Responses must conform to the questionnaire JSON schema\n\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage employments (`employments`) | - | Manage employments (`employment:write`) |\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "contractors",
                "eligibility-questionnaire"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "json_schema_version",
                  "value": "<integer>",
                  "description": "Version of the form schema"
                }
              ],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{bearerToken}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"employment_slug\": \"<uuid>\",\n  \"type\": \"<string>\",\n  \"responses\": {\n    \"key_0\": \"<string>\",\n    \"key_1\": \"<string>\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
